t; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">모집분야<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span>기계<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>자동차<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>금속<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>재료공학 전공자<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">모집인원<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : 1 ~ 2 </span>명<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. <u>모집기간 : 2013년 05월 31일(금), 18:00</u></span></font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">응시자격<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span>현재<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 3~4</span>학년에 재학중인 학생<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">전형절차<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span>서류전형<span lang=\"EN-US\"> -&gt; </span>면접전형<span lang=\"EN-US\"> -&gt; </span>인턴사원 채용 확정<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">제출서류<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span>이력서<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>자기소개서<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>성적증명서<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>자격증 사본<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">8. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">제출방법<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span>현장실습지원센터 이메일 접수<span lang=\"EN-US\">(imr122@kumoh.ac.kr)<o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">9. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">근무지<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span>㈜계양정밀 기술연구소 외<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>경북 김천시 소재<span lang=\"EN-US\">)<o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 10pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">10. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">지원내용<span lang=\"EN-US\"> <o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 12pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span>- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt\">사택 및 숙식 제공<span lang=\"EN-US\"> <o:p></o:p></span></span></font></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 5.9pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt